      {
        "node_id": "node_004",
        "title": "极小极大目标函数",
        "label": "目标函数",
        "summary": "定义生成器和判别器之间的博弈目标，形式为min_G max_D V(D,G)。",
        "description": "目标函数V(G,D) = E_{x~pdata}[logD(x)] + E_{z~pz}[log(1-D(G(z)))]。在最优判别器D*下，该函数转化为C(G) = -log4 + 2*JSD(pdata||pg)，其中JSD为Jensen-Shannon散度。",
        "type": "objective_function",
        "anchors": [
